From 366997dbb6effa7830b03cfdd1c208caaf683495 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:02:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] logger: emu stats v4 (v1d KL15/NM/ceiling,
 0x10A/0x142/0x68), PT-CAN as bus 2, can= counts

- frts.py: request 256 bytes, parse v4 (older 64/128/192-byte firmware unchanged),
  'kl15=... nm=TX|quiet ceil_left=... dyn2[...]' in the emu line, 0x0A/0x42 slot ids
  shown as 0x10A/0x142; CAN CSV gets a t_us column on the FlexRay device time axis;
  SavvyCAN CSV row helpers
- fr_ts_logger.py: --can also writes <output>.savvy.csv (FR1 bus 0, FR2 bus 1, PT-CAN bus 2),
  --savvy-csv / --no-savvy-csv, status/summary 'can=N (bus2:N ids=K)'
- test_logger_emulate.py: v4 device, V2 device with CAN records, V1 device with --can
- run.sh: C struct vs frts.py v4 layout check
---
